{title: Channa Ve}
{artist: Bhoot Akhil Sachdeva}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A]Mere Raanjhana,        [D]Mere [A]Raanjhana [A]
[A]Kyun dikhe mujhe tu,        [A]Sirhaane mere
[D]Soch ke teri baatein hum,        [E]Muskurane lage
Haaye haaye haaye,        [F#m]Kyun dikhe mujhe tu
[A]Sirhaane mere,        [D]Soch ke teri baatein hum
[E]Muskurane lage,        Kyun [Bm]dil se nikal ke aahein
[E]Lafzon pe aane lage,        [D]Kaisi teri [Bm]khuaari hai
Hum [E]gungunane [A]lage,        Channa [A]ve, channa [E]ve
[D]Kuchh to hai tere mere,        [E]Darmiyan kyun [A]lage
Channa [A]ve, channa [F#m]ve,        [D]Kuchh to hai tere mere
[E]Darmiyan kyun [A]lage channa ve,        Haaye [A]bhull gaya jag saara
[A]Tere naal pyar ae,        [D]Saari saari raat mujhe
[E]Tera intezaar hai ho [A],        Ho [A]bhull gaya jag saara
[D]Tere naal pyar ae,        [F#m]Saari saari raat mujhe
[E]Tera intezaar hai ho,        [Bm]Akhiyon mein dekho meri
[E]Teri hi pukaar ae,        [Bm]Tu meri dua mein base
[E]Itni si [A]guhaar hai,        Kyun [D]dil se nikal ke aahein
[A]Lafzon pe aane lage,        [E]Kaisi teri khuaari hai
Hum [D]gungunane [A]lage,        Channa [A]ve, [E]channa ve
Channa [A]ve, channa [E]ve,        [D]Kuchh to hai tere mere
[E]Darmiyan kyun [A]lage
